# vllm-project/vllm#55507 (open, head 14e86625f6, fetched 2026-09-06): seed the mamba align state index with the MAMBA group block size, not cache_config.block_size (vllm#53142). Dormant on the daily (no explicit --block-size: both are 1552), live the first time a block size is pinned. R202 C1; applied --fuzz=0 on the daily image tree 2026-09-06.
diff --git a/vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py b/vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py
index 0ac3f2f63b96..4960796b010f 100644
--- a/vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_states/mamba_hybrid.py
